{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":46695602,"ns":0,"title":"Asano contraction","extract":"In complex analysis, a discipline in mathematics, and in statistical physics, the Asano contraction or Asano–Ruelle contraction is a transformation on a separately affine multivariate polynomial. It was first presented in 1970 by Taro Asano to prove the Lee–Yang theorem in the Heisenberg spin model case.","description":"Transformation on a separately affine multivariate polynomial","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}